==Trivia==
*Given its design and English name, The Invisible Cat seems to be based on Griffin, the titular character in [[wikipedia:The Invisible Man|The Invisible Man]].
**The Evolved Form being a groom may also be a reference to [[Wikipedia:The Invisible Man and His Soon-to-Be Wife|The Invisible Man and His Soon-to-Be Wife]].

